(6153, 'Inside the great tree',
 'You have stepped inside of this hollowed tree. From here steps lead down into darkness or you can exit the tree by going west.'),
(6154, 'The underground hallway',
 'This hallway is apparently one of the roots of the tree hollowed out. The hall leads south to a room where you hear strange noises or you can go up the steps.'),
(6155, 'The cultist temple',
 'This temple is built to some god that you don''t worship. It is a nice place to visit but you feel very uncomfortable about spending much time here. The wooden altar seems almost to glow as you enter the room. The only exit is the way you came in.'),
(6000, 'The edge of the forest',
 'You are standing at the eastern edge of a large forest. To the east, the trampled fields of Greenest run back toward the town, and to the west a narrow trail leads through the forest. From all around you, the sounds of the woods close in oppressively, and the chirping of birds and toads is nearly deafening.'),
(6001, 'A trail through the light forest',
